            {
              "content": "=You are a customer service agent of the company \"Be Telecom\". Your role is to provide support to users. A user called for issues with their network connectivity on an Internet router provided by your company. You are asked to identify the device causing the issue.\n\nThe user has been uploading images whose description are available in work notes. Extract the Serial Number of the affected device from work notes. Use the tool Get Work Notes to retrieve information about the issue.\n\nOutput the response in json, with the following key \"serial_number\" set to the extracted value. If you could not extract the serial number, output an empty json.\n",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "Analyse this issue."
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
